{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-joolz-aer2-car-seat-adapter-set-2605-0189","content_id":"5e4b5b75-446c-4471-b92d-8c1afc73a38e","description":"Product Recall for Joolz Aer2 Car Seat Adapter Set presenting a risk of injuries.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"649a2c2f-62b5-48e7-bef4-423e1333115a","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-05-29T10:19:49+01:00","id":"649a2c2f-62b5-48e7-bef4-423e1333115a","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-05-29T10:19:49+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a195a35c7335e2ca6daacfb/2605-0189-product-recall-joolz-car-seat-adaptor.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Joolz Aer2 Car Seat Adapter Set</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of injuries because the car seat adapter may fail to properly engage and lock with the spring-loaded pin on the stroller chassis.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by Joolz.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Childcare articles and children’s equipment - Baby Car/Booster Seats</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Joolz</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Article Code</td>\n      <td>320400</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>8715688096512</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Serial Number</td>\n      <td>The Joolz Aer2 Car Seat Adapter Set starts with serial number NL311-</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sales Period</td>\n      <td>The affected products were sold between June 2025 and May 2026.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Black car seat adaptor to connect an infant car seat to a Joolz Aer2 stroller chassis.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_649a2c2f-62b5-48e7-bef4-423e1333115a\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a195a35c7335e2ca6daacfb/2605-0189-product-recall-joolz-car-seat-adaptor.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of injuries because the car seat adapter may fail to properly engage and lock with the spring-loaded pin on the stroller chassis. If this were to happen, the car seat can fully detach from the stroller and fall to the ground.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by Joolz. Consumers are asked to stop using the product immediately.</p>\n\n<p>For more information on this recall and to register for replacement adapters please visit: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.joolz.com/uk/en/product-recalls.html\">Sites-joolz-gb-Site</a> or contact <a href=\"mailto:csa@joolz.com\">csa@joolz.com</a>.</p>\n\n<p>For products sold by John Lewis, access: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.johnlewis.com/customer-services/shopping-with-us/product-recalls\">Product Recalls - John Lewis &amp; Partners</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2605-0189</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-29T09:21:12Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"childcare-articles-childrens-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-05-29","product_risk_level":"medium"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-05-29T10:21:12+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-joolz-aer2-car-seat-adapter-set-2605-0189","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-joolz-aer2-car-seat-adapter-set-2605-0189","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-joolz-aer2-car-seat-adapter-set-2605-0189","content_id":"5e4b5b75-446c-4471-b92d-8c1afc73a38e","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-05-29T09:21:12Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Joolz Aer2 Car Seat Adapter Set (2605-0189)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-joolz-aer2-car-seat-adapter-set-2605-0189","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value"